WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.5 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Check-ins, performance and development

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Short, regular check-ins, started now between co-founders, do more than a yearly appraisal.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Cover wins, blockers, priorities and feedback both ways.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Link each person's objectives to your first-year plan.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Agree a fair procedure for concerns before you need it.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You design your check-in rhythm and objectives for one role.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
